'''Ocean''' is an [[effect]] that was obtainable by purchasing the [[Beach Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Summer Event 2026|2026 Summer Event]].

== Appearance ==
The effect surrounds the knife with a neon blue and light cyan aura as well as sparkles of the same colors and tiny starfish.

